WindowLiftController (Root Node - LibraryNode, Repeat: true)
├── NodeList (Main state machine - Sequence)
    ├── IdleMonitoring
    │   ├── Command: WAIT_FOR_INPUT
    │   ├── EndCondition: (SwitchUp || SwitchDown || RemoteClose || ExpressUp || ExpressDown)
    │
    ├── DirectionDecision
    │   ├── PriorityChoice
    │       ├── ExpressUpDetected   → GOTO ExpressUpSequence
    │       ├── ExpressDownDetected → GOTO ExpressDownSequence  
    │       ├── ManualUpDetected    → GOTO ManualUpSequence
    │       ├── ManualDownDetected  → GOTO ManualDownSequence
    │       └── RemoteClose         → GOTO ExpressUpSequence
    │
    ├── ManualUpSequence (Sequence, SkipCondition: AntiPinchTriggered || OverCurrent || HallError)
    │   ├── SoftStartRamp_Up        (Open-loop PWM ramp 0→target, 150-250 ms)
    │   ├── ConstantSpeed_Up        (Open-loop constant PWM or light velocity PI)
    │   ├── EnterSoftStopZone? → SoftStopRamp_Up (position-triggered PWM table)
    │   ├── EndCondition: SwitchReleased || Position >= MaxPosition
    │   └── OnEnd → MotorBrake → IdleMonitoring
    │
    ├── ManualDownSequence (Sequence)
    │   ├── SoftStartRamp_Down
    │   ├── ConstantSpeed_Down
    │   └── EndCondition: SwitchReleased || Position <= MinPosition
    │
    ├── ExpressUpSequence (Sequence, highest priority)
    │   ├── NormalizationCheck
    │   │   └── SkipCondition: NormalizationValid && CyclesSinceLastNorm > 5
    │   │       → RunNormalization (multiple full cycles, build baseline map)
    │   │
    │   ├── SoftStartRamp_Up
    │   ├── ConstantSpeed_Up_WithAntiPinch
    │   │   ├── Parallel monitoring node: AntiPinchDetector_Up (always active in pinch zone)
    │   │   │   ├── RipplePeriodMonitor
    │   │   │   ├── DeltaPeriod > PositionDependentThreshold + ConfirmationCount >= 3
    │   │   │   └── PostCondition: AntiPinchTriggered = true → GOTO EmergencyReverse
    │   │   │
    │   ├── EnterPinchProtectionZone (Position > PinchZoneStart)
    │   │   └── Enable AntiPinchDetector_Up
    │   │
    │   ├── EnterSoftStopZone → SoftStopRamp_Up (open-loop PWM table)
    │   ├── Position >= MaxPosition - SealZone → MotorBrake + HoldPWM (small holding duty)
    │   └── EndCondition: PositionFullyClosed || AntiPinchTriggered
    │
    ├── ExpressDownSequence (Sequence)
    │   ├── SoftStartRamp_Down
    │   ├── ConstantSpeed_Down (no anti-pinch required by regulation)
    │   └── EndCondition: Position <= MinPosition
    │
    ├── EmergencyReverse (Sequence, highest priority override)
    │   ├── Invariant: AntiPinchTriggered || OverCurrent || ThermalShutdown
    │   ├── Immediate MotorStop (PWM=0 + brake)
    │   ├── ReverseDirection
    │   ├── SoftStartRamp_Down (short ramp)
    │   ├── RunDownForDistance (typically 100-200 mm or 300-500 ms)
    │   ├── MotorBrake
    │   ├── Clear AntiPinchTriggered flag
    │   └── Return → IdleMonitoring
    │
    └── FaultHandler (Parallel, always active)
        ├── OverTemperature → EmergencyReverse + DisableOutputs
        ├── HallSensorError → EmergencyReverse + SetFaultFlag
        ├── SupplyUnderVoltage → MotorBrake + WaitForRecovery
        └── CurrentLimitExceeded → EmergencyReverse

